    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a competitive game of war chess, where players can choose different chess piece factions and play against opponents by summoning monster chess pieces, with the goal of destroying the opponent's base. In the game, players can control their monster attacks, movements, and use skills. They can also purchase items in the store for monsters to use, and guide themselves to victory through reasonable tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >current game modes: lan play, local versus, ai mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features over 30 units,50+ skills, 20+ basic items and 10+ crafted items.</p>",
